1
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:31,919
=Remnants of Gold=

2
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:34,478
(Adapted from Gu Long's
"Flying Eagle over the Great Land")

3
00:01:34,479 --> 00:01:37,540
(The main characters
in this drama are fictional)

4
00:01:38,060 --> 00:01:40,780
=Episode 7=

5
00:01:44,959 --> 00:01:46,359
Do you kill everyone who comes here?

6
00:01:54,879 --> 00:01:55,680
No need to look.

7
00:01:58,599 --> 00:01:59,760
It's just me.

8
00:02:01,799 --> 00:02:04,840
It's rare for a person
to travel west alone.

9
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:09,080
It's rare for someone
who almost died here once

10
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,960
to come back.

11
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:12,759
Am I right?

12
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:24,120
We were terrified last time, too.

13
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:26,960
Shiquan Fort was abandoned first,

14
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:30,360
and now Lieyang Well
is almost abandoned, too.

15
00:02:36,288 --> 00:02:38,000
Once the roads
heading west are deserted,

16
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,919
no one will come
looking for gold anymore.

17
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,280
Am I right?

18
00:04:37,056 --> 00:04:38,120
How should I address you?

19
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:39,879
Yu Hou.

20
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:45,680
Sir,

21
00:04:47,040 --> 00:04:48,040
what are you looking for?

22
00:04:56,839 --> 00:04:58,000
I was careless last time.

23
00:04:59,920 --> 00:05:01,399
I didn't investigate you and your son.

24
00:05:05,399 --> 00:05:06,319
Seventeen,

25
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,560
go outside and enjoy the sun.

26
00:05:17,959 --> 00:05:19,560
You poisoned the feed.

27
00:05:24,519 --> 00:05:25,639
What poison in the feed?

28
00:05:27,408 --> 00:05:29,296
So this is what
guardians of the gold look like.

29
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:34,519
What are we supposed to look like?

30
00:05:52,879 --> 00:05:54,959
Where are
the 300,000 taels of gold buried?

31
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,439
I could ask your son instead.

32
00:06:04,360 --> 00:06:05,199
Seventeen,

33
00:06:07,199 --> 00:06:08,560
go somewhere further

34
00:06:08,959 --> 00:06:09,920
to enjoy the sun.

35
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,360
How far?

36
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:16,279
Across the street.

37
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:32,519
Seventeen,

38
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:34,439
go.

39
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:55,360
You came here seeking death.

40
00:06:55,879 --> 00:06:57,319
It's easy for me to kill you.

41
00:06:57,439 --> 00:06:58,639
No need for poison.

42
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:00,439
Really?

43
00:07:15,639 --> 00:07:16,759
I dare to kill you,

44
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,319
but you don't dare to kill me.

45
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,560
Because you want the gold.

46
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:23,360
When people desire something,
they have a weakness.

47
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,240
Your son out on the street...

48
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,720
Isn't he your weakness?

49
00:08:05,639 --> 00:08:07,040
People like us

50
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:10,199
shouldn't have loved ones!

51
00:08:16,959 --> 00:08:18,040
How many

52
00:08:19,639 --> 00:08:20,800
guardians of the gold

53
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,639
like you are there?

54
00:09:34,759 --> 00:09:36,480
Gold is heavier than life, isn't it?

55
00:09:36,639 --> 00:09:38,200
You still don't dare to kill me.

56
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,840
Most people in this world are fools,

57
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:42,759
never understanding it until they die!

58
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:44,960
Fine.

59
00:09:45,799 --> 00:09:47,039
Then I will kill you.

60
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,080
Let go of me!

61
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:48,639
♪Are climbing the mountain♪

62
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:51,000
♪A young girl♪

63
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,679
♪Waves her hand♪

64
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:56,240
♪I should go over, right?♪

65
00:10:56,240 --> 00:10:58,360
♪But the door is locked♪

66
00:10:58,639 --> 00:11:00,879
♪Should I stay away?♪

67
00:11:00,879 --> 00:11:03,279
♪But my heart is itching♪

68
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,240
Bancha.

69
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:06,960
Seventeen.

70
00:11:07,159 --> 00:11:08,480
How are you doing?

71
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:14,320
Are they your new women?

72
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:16,159
You rascal,

73
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,480
don't talk nonsense.

74
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,799
When have I ever had a woman?

75
00:11:20,639 --> 00:11:21,879
Then who are they?

76
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,519
Pretty ladies.

77
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,039
Pretty ladies.

78
00:11:53,480 --> 00:11:55,120
Women's clothes?

79
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,159
The last time you reached this place,

80
00:11:58,480 --> 00:12:00,159
Lieyang Well became deserted.

81
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,039
Drain

82
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:04,200
all of your blood later.

83
00:12:06,480 --> 00:12:07,639
Your son is outside.

84
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,384
Are you really making him
watch you kill someone?

85
00:12:16,919 --> 00:12:18,759
My son is across the street.

86
00:12:19,399 --> 00:12:22,120
Unless I tell him to come back,
he won't come back.

87
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,840
He's not very bright.

88
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:32,279
Pretty ladies, pretty ladies.

89
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:34,080
There are pretty ladies.

90
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:48,879
Pretty ladies.

91
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:49,840
There are pretty ladies.

92
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:51,960
♪Two mountain goats♪

93
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,919
♪Are climbing the mountain♪

94
00:12:54,360 --> 00:12:56,320
♪Should I go over?♪

95
00:13:03,759 --> 00:13:05,720
♪Are climbing the mountain♪

96
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:07,840
♪A little girl♪

97
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:10,080
♪Looks so pretty♪

98
00:13:10,519 --> 00:13:12,480
♪Should I go over?♪

99
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:14,679
Two pretty ladies are outside.

100
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:16,840
♪But the door is locked♪

101
00:13:18,919 --> 00:13:19,759
♪Should I stay away?♪

102
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:21,279
The two pretty ladies
are on the street.

103
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,759
♪But my heart is itching♪

104
00:13:22,759 --> 00:13:24,039
You go to the street, too.

105
00:13:25,399 --> 00:13:26,000
Go.

106
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:36,240
What are you doing?

107
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,080
I'm just getting ready

108
00:13:42,096 --> 00:13:43,200
to draw a bucket of water.

109
00:13:43,720 --> 00:13:45,480
♪Should I go over?♪

110
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:46,799
♪But the door is locked♪

111
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,879
Lieyang Well is the only spring here.

112
00:13:55,232 --> 00:13:57,072
What will we do if it gets contaminated?

113
00:13:58,112 --> 00:13:59,200
It won't get contaminated.

114
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,600
I was just preparing to pull him up,

115
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:14,600
bleed him dry,

116
00:14:14,879 --> 00:14:16,039
carry him out, and bury him.

117
00:14:30,759 --> 00:14:32,159
Does it have to be like this?

118
00:14:35,679 --> 00:14:37,840
When you passed by here heading east,

119
00:14:37,952 --> 00:14:40,576
you said you'd buy me highland
barley liquor when you returned.

120
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:41,480
Where's the liquor?

121
00:14:44,559 --> 00:14:47,440
There's someone in this well
who needs to be pulled up and bled dry,

122
00:14:48,096 --> 00:14:50,240
yet you're talking to me
about highland barley liquor?

123
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:54,440
You're Bancha, the man who never lies.

124
00:14:56,608 --> 00:14:57,510
The liquor is gone.

125
00:15:03,679 --> 00:15:05,360
Then you lied.

126
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:56,679
The guardians of the gold are here.

127
00:15:57,519 --> 00:15:58,279
Where?

128
00:15:59,216 --> 00:16:01,264
This is enchanting grass
of the Western Regions.

129
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:03,104
Someone specifically
transplanted it here.

130
00:16:03,639 --> 00:16:05,200
The first-year tender leaves are edible,

131
00:16:05,552 --> 00:16:07,296
and the seeds can be
ground into medicine.

132
00:16:08,192 --> 00:16:10,352
It's recorded in old formulas
from the Yuan Dynasty.

133
00:16:11,919 --> 00:16:13,840
They look like they're alive.

134
00:16:15,639 --> 00:16:16,720
They're dead now.

135
00:16:18,399 --> 00:16:19,360
They pull all their roots

136
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,879
out of the soil,

137
00:16:21,408 --> 00:16:23,200
roll into a ball,
and roll with the wind.

138
00:16:23,679 --> 00:16:25,000
The enchanting grass here

139
00:16:26,159 --> 00:16:27,480
has been dead for over ten years.

140
00:16:29,919 --> 00:16:31,720
Are they toxic now?

141
00:16:33,328 --> 00:16:35,200
If horses eat them
and then encounter water,

142
00:16:35,632 --> 00:16:37,790
people will start killing
each other within ten steps.

143
00:16:41,720 --> 00:16:43,720
Was it this grass that was used

144
00:16:43,919 --> 00:16:45,759
for the guardians of the gold's
poison feed?

145
00:17:00,208 --> 00:17:02,800
Exposing them directly to water
makes the toxicity even stronger.

146
00:17:03,519 --> 00:17:05,440
Even I would have to
take the antidote first.

147
00:17:06,704 --> 00:17:07,960
But once submerged in water,

148
00:17:08,688 --> 00:17:10,160
the toxicity dissipates immediately.

149
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:22,720
This street is 93 meters long.

150
00:17:23,400 --> 00:17:24,880
Light one stick every 10 meters.

151
00:17:25,599 --> 00:17:27,640
Tie Futu will arrive in 15 minutes.

152
00:17:28,680 --> 00:17:30,119
How do you know that, Luyao?

153
00:17:32,359 --> 00:17:34,000
We set out before dawn

154
00:17:34,400 --> 00:17:35,839
just to stay ahead.

155
00:17:36,432 --> 00:17:38,200
With the eagles flying
west along the way,

156
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,160
pushing back by 15 minutes,

157
00:17:40,279 --> 00:17:41,480
that would be them.

158
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:45,440
What incense is this?

159
00:17:45,920 --> 00:17:46,920
Water incense.

160
00:17:47,632 --> 00:17:49,640
Fifteen minutes later,
the moisture will thicken,

161
00:17:49,664 --> 00:17:51,750
and the whole street
will be covered in water mist.

162
00:17:51,759 --> 00:17:52,880
Pretty ladies.

163
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:56,759
Pretty ladies!

164
00:17:58,839 --> 00:18:00,279
The kid called me "pretty lady".

165
00:18:00,599 --> 00:18:01,319
Let's go over?

166
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,799
When Tie Futu and the others get here,

167
00:18:05,359 --> 00:18:07,480
they'll start killing each other, right?

168
00:18:09,136 --> 00:18:10,830
Just like my father and brothers did.

169
00:18:19,559 --> 00:18:20,359
You stay here.

170
00:18:21,559 --> 00:18:22,680
When the moisture rises,

171
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,799
keep this in your mouth.

172
00:18:31,559 --> 00:18:32,240
Luyao.

173
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,079
Pretty lady.

174
00:18:34,079 --> 00:18:34,759
Luyao!

175
00:18:37,839 --> 00:18:38,599
Could you

176
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:40,519
give me one more pill?

177
00:18:42,200 --> 00:18:43,000
For Fang?

178
00:18:48,064 --> 00:18:49,888
How are you going
to give it to him then?

179
00:18:53,936 --> 00:18:55,400
I'll risk my life to give it to him.

180
00:19:04,440 --> 00:19:06,200
If someone drowns in there,

181
00:19:07,279 --> 00:19:08,440
I'll never drink

182
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,759
from Lieyang Well again.

183
00:19:12,759 --> 00:19:15,200
Who is the woman that came with you?

184
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:20,440
Before, she was looking
for the guardians of the gold.

185
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,400
Now, someone else
is having her look for them.

186
00:19:24,920 --> 00:19:26,039
Let's bleed her dry

187
00:19:26,039 --> 00:19:27,400
and bury her together with him.

188
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:31,000
Hey,

189
00:19:35,400 --> 00:19:36,680
don't touch her.

190
00:19:39,079 --> 00:19:40,000
So,

191
00:19:40,400 --> 00:19:42,079
is she really your lady?

192
00:19:46,480 --> 00:19:47,839
I'm not like you.

193
00:19:49,799 --> 00:19:51,839
Fifteen years ago,
you hid it from everyone,

194
00:19:51,839 --> 00:19:53,759
fell in love with a woman,

195
00:19:54,480 --> 00:19:56,119
and had a son with her.

196
00:19:57,480 --> 00:20:00,720
People like us
aren't allowed to have families.

197
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,599
It's not like you don't know that.

198
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:07,480
Did you tell her everything?

199
00:20:08,519 --> 00:20:09,200
Tell her what?

200
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:11,839
About who we are

201
00:20:11,839 --> 00:20:13,079
and where the gold is buried.

202
00:20:16,880 --> 00:20:18,400
Can I ask you a few questions?

203
00:20:19,279 --> 00:20:20,240
Or maybe

204
00:20:21,279 --> 00:20:22,319
just one question?

205
00:20:27,319 --> 00:20:28,519
Do you really have to ask?

206
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:30,599
You don't have to answer.

207
00:20:31,360 --> 00:20:32,790
That way, it won't count as lying.

208
00:20:40,799 --> 00:20:42,400
Do you like this place?

209
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:52,160
She didn't ask,

210
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,359
so I didn't say.

211
00:21:04,680 --> 00:21:05,920
What if she asks?

212
00:21:13,119 --> 00:21:14,279
If she asks, I'll just say.

213
00:21:15,519 --> 00:21:18,160
I am Bancha, who doesn't lie.

214
00:21:19,960 --> 00:21:21,559
Who else did you tell before?

215
00:21:22,839 --> 00:21:24,400
I'll tell anyone who asks.

216
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:26,559
And kill them once I do.

217
00:21:27,839 --> 00:21:29,839
The Zhang lady didn't ask,

218
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:32,519
so I won't hurt her.

219
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:35,240
You aren't allowed to touch her, either.

220
00:21:36,839 --> 00:21:39,519
Actually, I think she knows everything.

221
00:21:40,519 --> 00:21:42,559
She's a particularly clever lady.

222
00:21:59,319 --> 00:22:01,319
She's the Zhang lady.

223
00:22:54,559 --> 00:22:55,920
What are you doing?

224
00:22:56,440 --> 00:22:57,720
Creating fog on this street.

225
00:22:58,279 --> 00:22:59,240
That's impossible.

226
00:23:21,079 --> 00:23:21,720
Go away.

227
00:23:22,519 --> 00:23:24,000
Don't let the mist touch you.

228
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:25,519
Why?

229
00:23:28,960 --> 00:23:30,079
Get far away.

230
00:23:31,079 --> 00:23:31,640
Get lost!

231
00:23:32,288 --> 00:23:33,310
I told you to get lost!

232
00:23:35,319 --> 00:23:36,359
The further, the better!

233
00:23:36,880 --> 00:23:38,160
Or I'll kill you!

234
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,519
What are you doing?

235
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,680
I'm going to bleed him.

236
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,519
He isn't dead yet.

237
00:24:42,039 --> 00:24:43,480
Once I bleed him, he will be.

238
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:53,920
Bancha,

239
00:24:54,359 --> 00:24:56,079
can you ask your friend
to wait a moment?

240
00:24:57,119 --> 00:24:58,079
How

241
00:24:58,559 --> 00:25:00,519
did you know he's my friend?

242
00:25:04,752 --> 00:25:06,550
He's one of the guardians of the gold,

243
00:25:07,880 --> 00:25:09,200
so he is your friend.

244
00:25:14,319 --> 00:25:15,119
See that?

245
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,519
She really knows everything.

246
00:25:17,568 --> 00:25:18,550
It's not hard to guess.

247
00:25:19,632 --> 00:25:21,808
My father and brothers
died from poison in the feed.

248
00:25:21,820 --> 00:25:24,384
The poison is made from
enchanting grass of the Western Regions.

249
00:25:25,319 --> 00:25:27,440
Lieyang Well is full
of enchanting grass,

250
00:25:28,144 --> 00:25:30,110
and you are the only ones
killing people here.

251
00:25:30,960 --> 00:25:31,960
This man

252
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:34,039
is looking for gold.

253
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:46,070
I didn't kill your father and brothers.

254
00:25:46,240 --> 00:25:47,480
But the poison is yours.

255
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:49,344
I said I didn't kill
your father and brothers.

256
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:54,440
The poison is yours,

257
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:56,480
isn't it?

258
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:01,359
It is mine.

259
00:26:02,839 --> 00:26:04,680
But who poisoned
your father and brothers?

260
00:26:05,808 --> 00:26:07,568
The poisoner will be here in 15 minutes.

261
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:13,680
Who?

262
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:16,240
Who used my poison to kill people?

263
00:26:16,559 --> 00:26:17,519
Tie Futu,

264
00:26:17,584 --> 00:26:19,744
the ruthless killer
from the Northwest Great Desert.

265
00:26:19,750 --> 00:26:21,660
You knew all this?
Why didn't you say anything?

266
00:26:21,696 --> 00:26:22,720
You didn't ask.

267
00:26:23,240 --> 00:26:24,839
How should I know you wanted to know?

268
00:26:31,000 --> 00:26:32,079
What did I say?

269
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:34,759
This lady knows everything.

270
00:27:10,480 --> 00:27:11,799
I want to ask him a few questions.

271
00:27:13,279 --> 00:27:14,359
Kill him after I'm done.

272
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:06,680
Han Jade.

273
00:28:07,519 --> 00:28:08,640
Eight-Cut Wengzhong.

274
00:28:09,119 --> 00:28:10,119
Am I right?

275
00:28:12,160 --> 00:28:14,160
Why do you like these things?

276
00:28:14,816 --> 00:28:16,000
Because they're expensive.

277
00:28:17,319 --> 00:28:19,279
Being with them keeps my mind at ease.

278
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,319
Are you uneasy now?

279
00:28:26,759 --> 00:28:27,880
My mind is made up.

280
00:28:28,519 --> 00:28:29,599
I'm not uneasy anymore.

281
00:28:35,759 --> 00:28:36,920
I've thrown away

282
00:28:37,296 --> 00:28:38,200
the bell you gave me.

283
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:41,519
Are you done asking?

284
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:48,799
My men

285
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:51,070
will arrive at Lieyang Well very soon.

286
00:29:13,960 --> 00:29:15,519
You are about to die.

287
00:29:19,968 --> 00:29:21,550
What's there to regret about dying?

288
00:29:22,288 --> 00:29:24,070
What's the point of gold
once you're dead?

289
00:29:24,208 --> 00:29:25,270
What's the point of living?

290
00:29:25,824 --> 00:29:27,000
What's the point of living?

291
00:29:27,900 --> 00:29:30,448
If evil thoughts harbor in your mind,
you'll act on them anyway.

292
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,480
Either die,

293
00:29:32,079 --> 00:29:33,519
or die after getting rich.

294
00:29:33,759 --> 00:29:34,960
You die in the end anyway.

295
00:29:37,359 --> 00:29:38,960
How did you turn out like this?

296
00:29:39,480 --> 00:29:40,559
I've always been like this.

297
00:29:59,240 --> 00:30:00,200
You knew long ago

298
00:30:00,752 --> 00:30:02,110
that the guardians of the gold

299
00:30:02,839 --> 00:30:04,319
were at Lieyang Well, right?

300
00:30:08,319 --> 00:30:10,279
Why did you keep having Fang follow me?

301
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:12,440
So you knew it.

302
00:30:16,119 --> 00:30:17,200
Fang's spear

303
00:30:17,632 --> 00:30:19,750
was in the cloth bundle
in your room all along.

304
00:30:23,920 --> 00:30:25,240
That spear is very costly, too.

305
00:30:26,319 --> 00:30:27,119
I gave him the spear

306
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:29,440
so he'd obey your orders
and protect your life.

307
00:30:29,440 --> 00:30:30,319
Move aside!

308
00:30:35,136 --> 00:30:36,880
I still have a few
more questions to ask.

309
00:30:37,039 --> 00:30:38,359
Who do you think you are?

310
00:30:46,359 --> 00:30:48,599
I just want to ask him a few questions.

311
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,720
Just let her ask.

312
00:30:52,039 --> 00:30:53,160
We can listen up.

313
00:30:57,160 --> 00:30:58,440
You dense villain.

314
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,000
Tie Futu

315
00:31:18,599 --> 00:31:20,720
sent my family an escort order
and poisoned them.

316
00:31:21,599 --> 00:31:22,799
You knew beforehand.

317
00:31:26,759 --> 00:31:27,440
Sorry,

318
00:31:28,559 --> 00:31:29,640
I wanted the gold.

319
00:31:30,768 --> 00:31:32,200
Expenses are high in the south.

320
00:31:32,359 --> 00:31:34,240
Three hundred thousand taels
of gold are a lot.

321
00:31:44,432 --> 00:31:47,024
The Zhang Escort Agency is
under your jurisdiction in Liangzhou.

322
00:31:47,616 --> 00:31:49,240
You're the chief official of Liangzhou.

323
00:31:50,240 --> 00:31:52,519
Colluding with bandits
to murder and rob...

324
00:31:53,024 --> 00:31:54,310
Does the Commander-in-Chief

325
00:31:55,839 --> 00:31:57,319
know you're doing this?

326
00:32:01,599 --> 00:32:02,440
Does he know?

327
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:08,039
You said the General

328
00:32:09,000 --> 00:32:10,440
was like a father and brother to you.

329
00:32:16,640 --> 00:32:17,759
So that's how it is.

330
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,079
It was General

331
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:24,359
who wanted the 300,000 taels of gold.

332
00:32:25,680 --> 00:32:26,440
No.

333
00:32:29,839 --> 00:32:31,920
So it was
the Commander-in-Chief of Gansu

334
00:32:32,759 --> 00:32:35,640
who ordered you and Tie Futu
to murder and rob.

335
00:32:37,319 --> 00:32:38,119
That's impossible.

336
00:32:59,279 --> 00:33:00,720
Do you want to die, too?

337
00:33:01,599 --> 00:33:03,759
I told you long ago
that you're too bloodthirsty.

338
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,400
I won't rest easy

339
00:33:06,599 --> 00:33:07,680
until everyone is dead!

340
00:33:10,759 --> 00:33:12,720
It's only because you raised a son

341
00:33:13,720 --> 00:33:15,319
that you can't let anything go.

342
00:33:15,320 --> 00:33:16,256
What choice do I have?

343
00:33:17,279 --> 00:33:18,720
I already have a son.

344
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:21,680
What else can I do?

345
00:34:08,079 --> 00:34:09,840
Is the mist poisonous?

346
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:21,630
It's not poisonous.

347
00:34:22,639 --> 00:34:23,519
It's just water vapor.

348
00:34:25,119 --> 00:34:26,320
To be safe,

349
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,630
we still shouldn't cross.

350
00:34:29,079 --> 00:34:29,920
Guys,

351
00:34:30,239 --> 00:34:31,320
cover your mouths.

352
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,239
Put the guy

353
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:37,960
up front.

354
00:35:07,239 --> 00:35:07,960
Hold on to him.

355
00:35:08,400 --> 00:35:09,400
Don't let him run.

356
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:48,159
If you hadn't taken it upon yourself

357
00:35:48,159 --> 00:35:49,760
to poison both groups from Lieyang Well

358
00:35:49,760 --> 00:35:50,719
and Shiquan Fort,

359
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:51,950
would things have come to this?

360
00:35:51,968 --> 00:35:54,030
What choice did I have?
They wanted the gold!

361
00:36:48,039 --> 00:36:48,679
Fang!

362
00:36:49,679 --> 00:36:51,239
It's the Zhang lady.

363
00:37:32,944 --> 00:37:34,230
Let me ask you one more time.

364
00:37:36,239 --> 00:37:37,599
You knew all along

365
00:37:38,272 --> 00:37:40,048
about the murder of
my father and brothers?

366
00:37:42,880 --> 00:37:43,679
Yes.

367
00:37:44,559 --> 00:37:46,239
Did General order you to do this?

368
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:48,199
I wanted to kill your family.

369
00:37:49,040 --> 00:37:50,440
It has nothing to do with him.

370
00:37:50,450 --> 00:37:51,630
You're not that kind of person.

371
00:37:51,648 --> 00:37:52,840
What kind of person am I then?

372
00:37:58,719 --> 00:37:59,760
Let's part ways here.

373
00:38:00,432 --> 00:38:02,110
Let's settle everything
once and for all.

374
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:09,280
You've never killed anyone before.

375
00:38:10,119 --> 00:38:11,000
How will you

376
00:38:14,079 --> 00:38:15,199
get revenge like this?

377
00:38:20,000 --> 00:38:20,880
Kill me.

378
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:22,639
Kill me.

379
00:38:25,639 --> 00:38:27,039
Fang!

380
00:38:27,039 --> 00:38:28,159
It's me, Pingping.

381
00:38:43,480 --> 00:38:44,679
Let them kill you then.

382
00:39:19,664 --> 00:39:22,480
Haven't enough people looked
for the gold over these 30 years?

383
00:39:22,800 --> 00:39:24,199
Just let them search.

384
00:39:24,384 --> 00:39:25,670
You kill whoever wants to look?

385
00:39:25,880 --> 00:39:26,679
Are you crazy?

386
00:39:36,440 --> 00:39:38,519
He's run off,
and you're still fighting? You fool.

387
00:40:07,039 --> 00:40:08,159
It's me, Pingping.

388
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,039
Pingping...

389
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:12,599
Hurry.

390
00:40:12,640 --> 00:40:13,280
Open your mouth.

391
00:40:13,400 --> 00:40:14,100
Open your mouth.

392
00:40:29,639 --> 00:40:30,880
Their mouths were covered.

393
00:40:30,880 --> 00:40:32,290
Where did the feed poison come from?

394
00:40:32,360 --> 00:40:34,608
It's from the mist and the things
on the ground, I think.

395
00:40:35,199 --> 00:40:36,639
Why didn't you realize this earlier?

396
00:40:36,639 --> 00:40:38,519
We've never seen
anything like this before.

397
00:40:56,119 --> 00:40:57,639
Why didn't you go there?

398
00:40:57,840 --> 00:40:59,119
Didn't you stay behind, too?

399
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,480
We gave you 100 taels of gold.

400
00:41:11,552 --> 00:41:13,424
You ought to do something for it, right?

401
00:41:30,519 --> 00:41:31,760
What about my men?

402
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:34,800
It's too late for them.

403
00:41:34,928 --> 00:41:36,190
We don't have that much antidote.

404
00:41:36,719 --> 00:41:37,639
Antidote?

405
00:41:52,416 --> 00:41:53,824
What kind of antidote is it?

406
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:55,190
Universal Antidote.

407
00:42:31,710 --> 00:42:32,912
Take him to the main house.

408
00:43:13,340 --> 00:43:15,820
(Preview of the Next Episode)

409
00:43:16,599 --> 00:43:18,559
If you want to die,
I'll send you on your way!

410
00:43:20,639 --> 00:43:21,679
Kill this jerk!

411
00:43:21,679 --> 00:43:23,920
- Kill him!
- Kill him!

412
00:43:26,440 --> 00:43:27,800
Where is the gold?

413
00:43:27,920 --> 00:43:29,440
Keep heading west.

414
00:43:29,880 --> 00:43:31,199
Once you pass Shiquan Fort,

415
00:43:32,039 --> 00:43:34,159
my son and I will take you there.

416
00:43:35,400 --> 00:43:40,400
=Remnants of Gold=
